Changes a topic's intake while the topic is not yet live: its subject, angle, scope, category, card count, brief or the topics it builds on. Restate the whole intake, with what is wrong fixed, and say why: this stores the intake's next version and updates the topic, and the chats writing the topic read the new one from then on. Read the current intake with read_topic first, so nothing you meant to keep is lost. A topic's name stays as it was accepted.
